message:
{{#is_alert}}A listing from a real email failed to load for {{listing_source.name}} after normal retries and browser fallback. Inspect the corresponding parse attempt and backend listing_access_failed/browser_render_failed diagnostics.{{/is_alert}}

{{#is_recovery}}No final email listing access failures were recorded in the last 15 minutes. A quiet period does not prove provider recovery.{{/is_recovery}}

Passive monitoring only: no scheduled provider requests. Manual imports and diagnostic probes do not trigger this alert. HTTP 404/410 removals and recovered browser challenges are excluded. Photo and LLM failures are outside this alert. No new emails means no alert; do not send test requests to check recovery.
